# 🏢 Shared Folder + Network Troubleshooting

The Finance shared-folder problem may involve more than one layer.

A structured investigation is:

```text
User
 ↓
Network Connectivity
 ↓
Server Reachability
 ↓
Authentication
 ↓
Security Group
 ↓
Share Permissions
 ↓
NTFS Permissions
 ↓
Folder Access
```

If the user is authorized and is missing the appropriate security group:

1. Confirm authorization.
2. Add the user to the appropriate security group.
3. Allow time for the membership change to apply.
4. Test access.
5. Verify with the user.
6. Document the change.

Do not modify permissions simply because a user cannot access a folder.

