# ⭐ Key Lessons From Day 66

Today's most important lesson was:

> **Diagnose before changing anything.**

A good Help Desk technician does not simply run commands or change configurations randomly.

The process should be:

```text
Gather Information
        ↓
Determine Scope
        ↓
Check Basic Conditions
        ↓
Collect Evidence
        ↓
Interpret Results
        ↓
Identify Likely Cause
        ↓
Make Authorized Change
        ↓
Retest
        ↓
Verify With User
        ↓
Document
        ↓
Escalate If Necessary
```

